# ZealLab: AI assistant instructions.
#
# These are local working notes and this is a public repository, so none of
# them are committed. CLAUDE.md is the source of truth; AGENTS.md (Codex) and
# GEMINI.md are copies made by script/zeallab-sync-agent-docs.sh.
#
# Anchored with a leading slash so they only match the repo root. Upstream
# opencode ships its own per-package AGENTS.md files under packages/** that are
# genuine engineering docs and stay tracked.
/CLAUDE.md
/CLAUDE.local.md
/AGENTS.md
/AGENTS.local.md
/GEMINI.md
/GEMINI.local.md

# Assistant working directories / other instruction conventions.
# (.codex is already ignored above.)
/.claude/
/.gemini/
/.cursor/
/.cursorrules
/.windsurfrules
/.aider*
/.github/copilot-instructions.md
